<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I seek and I behold You.</l><l>I look into Your face.</l><l>The index of Your eyes,</l><l>Your thoughts and feelings manifest.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>This treasure is the glorious Christ,</l><l>Our source and our supply.</l><l>We have this treasure in us.</l><l>Lord, we look into Your eyes.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
